{"seq":1,"slug":"refund-credit-allocation-model","title":"退款入账与原路/余额/优惠分摊资金来源模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/refund-settlement-intergration/refund-credit-allocation-model","wordCount":3046,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"退款入账与原路-余额-优惠分摊资金来源模型\">退款入账与原路/余额/优惠分摊资金来源模型</h1><p>一笔用「银行卡付 60 + 钱包余额付 30 + 满减券抵 10」凑成的 100 元订单，买家只退回其中一件 40 元的商品时，系统要回答的不是「退 40 元」，而是四个彼此独立的问题：这 40 元分别从哪个资金来源扣、按什么比例扣、优惠券要不要跟着退、以及退款应当打回银行卡、退回余额还是两者都退。把「退款金额」当成一个标量来处理的系统，几乎必然出现余额对不平、优惠被重复受益、渠道对账挂账的连锁故障。这一节要建立的就是<strong>退款入账的资金来源归属模型</strong>——把一个退款金额分解成若干 (资金来源, 金额) 对的规则集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-退款是一组来源向量而非单一金额\">核心概念：退款是一组来源向量而非单一金额</h2><p>退款的本质不是「减钱」，而是「沿某个方向把钱还回去」。方向由订单建立时记录的资金来源构成决定，因此订单在创建那一刻就必须落一份不可变的 <strong>payment composition（支付构成）</strong>：每个来源的类型、金额、当时的汇率、渠道侧的原始交易号。这份构成是退款分摊的唯一权威输入，事后不得从订单快照反推。</p>\n<p>跨境电商订单的资金来源通常有五类，它们在会计语义和监管约束上完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资金来源</th>\n<th>平台账上性质</th>\n<th>退款目标</th>\n<th>可否改道</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>外部卡 / 本地支付方式</td>\n<td>渠道在途资产</td>\n<td>原路退回同一卡/账户</td>\n<td>卡组织规则强约束，一般不可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台余额（储值/退款金）</td>\n<td>对买家的负债</td>\n<td>退回买家余额</td>\n<td>可，且常常是默认降级目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>礼品卡 / 代金券（有价）</td>\n<td>售出的预付负债</td>\n<td>退回原卡或发新卡</td>\n<td>视发卡条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>满减券 / 折扣码（无价）</td>\n<td>未确认的营销费用</td>\n<td>按规则返还或不返还</td>\n<td>可，纯营销决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积分 / 忠诚度点数</td>\n<td>递延负债或费用</td>\n<td>返还点数或折算现金</td>\n<td>可，按计划条款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>区分「有价凭证」与「无价折扣」是这一层最容易踩的坑。礼品卡是买家真金白银买来的预付负债，退款时必须等额返还同等效力；而满减券是平台补贴的营销费用，退款规则由营销条款决定——很多平台的规则是「全额退款才返还券，部分退款不返还」，也有「按未退比例返还」。把两者混在同一张 <code>coupons</code> 表里，就无法为它们写出不同的返还策略。</p>\n<p>订单支付构成与退款分摊之间的关系可以这样表达：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  O[&quot;订单 100 元&lt;br/&gt;支付构成快照&quot;]&#10;  O --&gt; C[&quot;外部卡 60&quot;]&#10;  O --&gt; W[&quot;平台余额 30&quot;]&#10;  O --&gt; V[&quot;满减券 10&lt;br/&gt;(无价)&quot;]&#10;  R[&quot;部分退款请求&lt;br/&gt;商品 40 元&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;分摊引擎&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; P1[&quot;按比例分摊&quot;]&#10;  P1 --&gt; C2[&quot;卡退 24.0&quot;]&#10;  P1 --&gt; W2[&quot;余额退 12.0&quot;]&#10;  P1 --&gt; V2[&quot;券不退&lt;br/&gt;(留存/按条款)&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt; L[&quot;账本分录&lt;br/&gt;+ 渠道退款单&quot;]&#10;  W2 --&gt; L\">graph TD\n  O[\"订单 100 元&lt;br/&gt;支付构成快照\"]\n  O --&gt; C[\"外部卡 60\"]\n  O --&gt; W[\"平台余额 30\"]\n  O --&gt; V[\"满减券 10&lt;br/&gt;(无价)\"]\n  R[\"部分退款请求&lt;br/&gt;商品 40 元\"] --&gt; S[\"分摊引擎\"]\n  S --&gt; P1[\"按比例分摊\"]\n  P1 --&gt; C2[\"卡退 24.0\"]\n  P1 --&gt; W2[\"余额退 12.0\"]\n  P1 --&gt; V2[\"券不退&lt;br/&gt;(留存/按条款)\"]\n  C2 --&gt; L[\"账本分录&lt;br/&gt;+ 渠道退款单\"]\n  W2 --&gt; L</pre><p>不管分摊算法选哪一种，有一条恒等式必须始终成立：退款分摊出的各来源金额之和，必须精确等于本次退款总额，不允许出现「卡退 24.01、余额退 11.99、合计 36 却宣称退了 40」这类舍入裂缝。这一约束与上一章讲过的分录平衡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i p_i = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是同一件事在不同层次上的投影——分摊层保证「来源之和对齐总额」，账本层保证「借贷之和为零」，两层都不能松。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原路退回-强约束-期限与降级链\">原路退回：强约束、期限与降级链</h2><p>「原路退回（refund to original payment method）」在多数司法辖区不是产品偏好而是监管要求。欧盟 PSD2 与卡组织规则都要求商户退款回到原支付工具，Visa 与 Mastercard 的争议处理流程也以「原交易可关联」为前提；Stripe 的退款文档明确写出退款会退回到原始支付方式，并指出部分支付方式（如某些银行转账、现金类线下付款）不支持原路退回（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/refunds\">Stripe Refunds</a>）。这带来两个工程后果。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>退款必须持有原交易号</strong>。退款单不是独立的一笔支付，而是原授权/清算记录的引用（对 Visa 是关联原 trace、对 Stripe 是 <code>payment_intent</code> 上的 refund 对象）。因此支付构成里那张「来源 → 渠道交易号」的映射表是不可重建的核心资产。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>原路退回存在时间窗</strong>。卡类退款通常要求在原始清算后约 180 天内发起（Visa 的退款处理窗口惯例，来源：Visa Merchant Rules 摘要），超过窗口则无法走原路退款接口，只能改由平台余额或人工转账兜底。这意味着退款引擎必须判断「原路通道是否仍可用」，并据此在<strong>降级链</strong>上选择落点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;退款请求&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;原渠道退款接口&lt;br/&gt;是否可用？&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|可用且未超窗| C[&quot;原路退回&lt;br/&gt;同卡/同账户&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|超窗或渠道不支持| D{&quot;买家在平台&lt;br/&gt;有余额账户？&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|有| E[&quot;退回平台余额&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|无| F[&quot;登记未付退款&lt;br/&gt;走人工出款/转账&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; G[&quot;写退款单 + 账本分录&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"退款请求\"] --&gt; B{\"原渠道退款接口&lt;br/&gt;是否可用？\"}\n  B --&gt;|可用且未超窗| C[\"原路退回&lt;br/&gt;同卡/同账户\"]\n  B --&gt;|超窗或渠道不支持| D{\"买家在平台&lt;br/&gt;有余额账户？\"}\n  D --&gt;|有| E[\"退回平台余额\"]\n  D --&gt;|无| F[\"登记未付退款&lt;br/&gt;走人工出款/转账\"]\n  C --&gt; G[\"写退款单 + 账本分录\"]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>微信支付、支付宝等本地支付渠道同样遵循原路退回：退款有效期通常限定在订单支付后一年内，超过期限的订单无法通过原路接口退款（来源：微信支付《退款》文档、支付宝开放平台退款接口说明）。跨境电商因此常见「卡部分原路退回 + 剩余退回余额」的混合结果——此时订单状态必须能同时容纳「已部分原路退」与「已部分余额退」两个维度，而不是一个布尔 <code>refunded</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优惠分摊-按比例-逐项与顺序三种模型\">优惠分摊：按比例、逐项与顺序三种模型</h2><p>当折扣作用于多件商品时，折扣必须被「分摊（allocate）」到具体行项目上，否则部分退款无法计算应该保留多少折扣。三种主流模型在工程上取舍不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>部分退款折扣处理</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按比例分摊</td>\n<td>每行按原价占比摊折扣</td>\n<td>退该行净额，剩余行折扣不变</td>\n<td>通用、最多平台默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐项分摊</td>\n<td>折扣明确挂到某行</td>\n<td>退的是该行含折扣净额</td>\n<td>单品满减券、赠品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顺序分摊</td>\n<td>折扣先冲前几行，冲完为止</td>\n<td>先退的行可能全额退</td>\n<td>满 N 件减、阶梯优惠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按比例分摊最通用，其数学形式为：设行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 原价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，订单折扣总额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，则行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 承担的折扣为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i = D \\cdot \\frac{p_i}{\\sum_j p_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2294em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的实付净额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i = p_i - d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。当买家只退第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行时，退款基数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这一条是整个模型的基石：<strong>部分退款的金额必须是分摊后的净额，绝不能用原价计算</strong>，否则买家通过「买了用、部分退」可以拿回超过实付的钱。</p>\n<p>按比例分摊的固有问题是舍入。折扣 10 元摊到三行 33.33 / 33.33 / 33.34 上，逐行计算会得到 3.333 / 3.333 / 3.334，四舍五入后之和可能不等于 10。行业通行解法是<strong>最大余数法（largest remainder method）</strong>：先各取整数部分，再把余数按小数部分降序分配给行，直到分配合计精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>。分摊结果必须持久化到行级，退款时直接读取，绝不重算——因为重算依赖的订单快照可能已经被后续操作改写。</p>\n<p>分摊还决定了两件容易被忽略的事。其一是<strong>税务分摊</strong>：跨境订单的增值税/消费税通常随行项目计，折扣按比例分摊后，应税基数也要按同比例下调，否则会出现「退了货却仍多缴了税」。其二是<strong>佣金分摊</strong>：平台对卖家的抽佣一般按净额计提，退款时佣金也要按同口径反向冲销，详见后文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分退款的分摊算法与精度处理\">部分退款的分摊算法与精度处理</h2><p>把前述规则落成可执行的算法，退款分摊大致是四步。</p>\n<p>第一，确定可退基数。对全额退款，基数等于支付构成中各来源原额；对部分退款，基数等于被退行项目的分摊后净额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的集合。</p>\n<p>第二，按来源类型分流。原始来源中「外部渠道」与「平台余额」属于可退现金类来源，参与金额分摊；「无价折扣」不参与现金分摊，只按营销条款决定是否返还。</p>\n<p>第三，对现金类来源按比例分摊退款额：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_k = R \\cdot \\frac{a_k}{\\sum_m a_m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0933em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 为本次退款额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为来源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 在支付构成中的原始金额。仍用最大余数法保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_k r_k = R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 精确成立。</p>\n<p>第四，最小货币单位与不可再分约束。外币退款要按<strong>退款发生日</strong>汇率折算，而不是订单支付日——差额进入汇兑损益科目，而不是被抹掉。对不支持小数的最小单位（如日元无小数），分摊必须以最小单位（1 日元）为单位取整，否则渠道接口会直接拒单。</p>\n<p>一个具体算例能说明为什么必须保存分摊结果而非即时重算。订单：卡 60 + 余额 30 + 券 10，总商品 100 元，其中商品 A 原价 50、商品 B 原价 50。全单折扣 10 元按比例分摊，A、B 各承担 5 元，A 的分摊后净额 45 元。买家退 A：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>卡</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><mn>90</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30.00</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>余额</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>90</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15.00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{卡}} = 45 \\cdot \\frac{60}{90} = 30.00,\\quad r_{\\text{余额}} = 45 \\cdot \\frac{30}{90} = 15.00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">卡</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30.00</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">余额</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15.00</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若当初没有落行级分摊结果，事后仅凭「退了 A 一件」和订单原价，是无法唯一还原出「A 应付 45」这个数字的——凭证不同，结果就不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"佣金与费用的反向冲销\">佣金与费用的反向冲销</h2><p>对平台自营，退款只需冲减收入；但对多卖家市场（marketplace），退款同时触发对卖家的结算调整。规则通常是：平台按订单净额计佣，退款时按<strong>同一净额口径</strong>反向计佣。设某行净额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，佣金率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，则退款应冲销的佣金为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta f = n_i \\cdot \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>现金退给买家 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的同时，卖家已结算/待结算余额被扣回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，平台佣金收入被冲销 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，净效果是平台承担了支付通道手续费与可能的汇兑损失。通道手续费在多数卡组织规则下<strong>不予退还</strong>（Visa/Mastercard 退款不返还原始交易手续费，来源：Visa Merchant Rules；Stripe 亦说明手续费不随退款退回，来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/refunds\">Stripe Refunds</a>），因此一次全额退款往往让平台净亏损一笔手续费与汇兑点差——这部分必须显式记入 <code>5000-*</code> 费用类科目，而不是藏在收入里。</p>\n<p>对卖家而言，退款发生在<strong>结算之后</strong>还是<strong>结算之前</strong>，处理路径完全不同：结算前直接冲减待结算余额即可；结算后则需要从卖家可用余额扣回，余额不足时形成**负余额（negative balance）**或对卖家的应收挂账。负余额是市场平台最典型的资金风险敞口，必须在账户模型里被显式建模，而不是靠「反正卖家还会再卖」来兜底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>退款入账的资金来源模型，是把「退多少钱」拆成「从哪退、退多少、按什么规则退」三件事的规则系统。要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>支付构成快照</strong>在订单创建时落库且不可变，是退款分摊的唯一权威输入，禁止事后从订单反推。</li>\n<li><strong>原路退回是监管强约束</strong>，必须持有原渠道交易号；存在时间窗（卡类约 180 天，本地支付约一年），超窗走余额或人工出款降级链。</li>\n<li><strong>优惠必须分摊到行级并持久化</strong>，部分退款按分摊后净额计算，绝不能按原价退。</li>\n<li><strong>按比例分摊 + 最大余数法</strong>是处理多来源、多行、多币种舍入的通行解法，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_k r_k = R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 精确成立。</li>\n<li><strong>手续费与汇兑损益显式入费用科目</strong>；渠道手续费通常不随退款返还，退款可能带来净平台损失。</li>\n<li><strong>市场平台退款触发佣金反向冲销与卖家结算调整</strong>，结算后扣回不足即形成负余额敞口。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;退款入账模型&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;支付构成快照&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;原路退回与降级链&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;优惠行级分摊&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; E[&quot;精度与多币种&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; F[&quot;佣金冲销与负余额&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; G[&quot;可验算的来源向量&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[\"退款入账模型\"] --&gt; B[\"支付构成快照\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"原路退回与降级链\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"优惠行级分摊\"]\n  A --&gt; E[\"精度与多币种\"]\n  A --&gt; F[\"佣金冲销与负余额\"]\n  B --&gt; G[\"可验算的来源向量\"]\n  C --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"退款入账与原路/余额/优惠分摊资金来源模型","id":"退款入账与原路-余额-优惠分摊资金来源模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：退款是一组来源向量而非单一金额","id":"核心概念-退款是一组来源向量而非单一金额"},{"level":2,"text":"原路退回：强约束、期限与降级链","id":"原路退回-强约束-期限与降级链"},{"level":2,"text":"优惠分摊：按比例、逐项与顺序三种模型","id":"优惠分摊-按比例-逐项与顺序三种模型"},{"level":2,"text":"部分退款的分摊算法与精度处理","id":"部分退款的分摊算法与精度处理"},{"level":2,"text":"佣金与费用的反向冲销","id":"佣金与费用的反向冲销"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"提现失败重试、KYC 限额与跨境合规实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/wallet-lifecycle-topup-withdraw/payout-failure-retry-kyc-limits"},"next":{"title":"结算周期、平台佣金抽成与多卖家拆账机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/refund-settlement-intergration/settlement-clearing-split-mechanism"}}